{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "01V4", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : X \\to S$", "MATH_0002": "$\\sigma : S \\to X$", "MATH_0003": "$f$", "MATH_0004": "$s \\in S$", "MATH_0005": "$f$", "MATH_0006": "$x = \\sigma(s)$", "MATH_0007": "$\\Spec(A) = U \\subset S$", "MATH_0008": "$s$", "MATH_0009": "$\\Spec(B) = V \\subset X$", "MATH_0010": "$x$", "MATH_0011": "$f(V) \\subset U$", "MATH_0012": "$\\sigma(U) \\subset V$", "MATH_0013": "$I = \\Ker(\\sigma^\\# : B \\to A)$", "MATH_0014": "$I/I^2$", "MATH_0015": "$A$", "MATH_0016": "$B^\\wedge \\cong A[[x_1, \\ldots, x_d]]$", "MATH_0017": "$A$", "MATH_0018": "$B^\\wedge$", "MATH_0019": "$B$", "MATH_0020": "$I$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\item", "STRUCT_0005": "\\end{enumerate}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-section-smooth-morphism}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:01d5b4e9f582c92bf8559f2b0a94cd5450c854ef6f0e497b40b92040d08f55ed", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:038a2984289c2626f2e0e7104d26e27c46da03d99a632c51f14307c415b9681f", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of schemes.\nLet <MATH_0002> be a section of <MATH_0003>.\nLet <MATH_0004> be a point such that <MATH_0005> is smooth at <MATH_0006>.\nThen there exist affine open neighbourhoods\n<MATH_0007> of <MATH_0008> and <MATH_0009>\nof <MATH_0010> such that\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0011> and <MATH_0012>,\n<STRUCT_0003> with <MATH_0013> the module <MATH_0014>\nis a free <MATH_0015>-module, and\n<STRUCT_0004> <MATH_0016> as <MATH_0017>-algebras where\n<MATH_0018> denotes the completion of <MATH_0019> with respect to <MATH_0020>.\n<STRUCT_0005>\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:c80fec2a11d86d2532d054b951e1a9cb686cba7322e74d1f2ec0eb20310cf579", "unit_id": "tag:05D9:stateme