{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "01V4", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$U \\subset S$", "MATH_0002": "$s$", "MATH_0003": "$V \\subset f^{-1}(U)$", "MATH_0004": "$x$", "MATH_0005": "$U' \\subset \\sigma^{-1}(V)$", "MATH_0006": "$s$", "MATH_0007": "$V' = f^{-1}(U') \\cap V$", "MATH_0008": "$V' = U' \\times_U V$", "MATH_0009": "$U'$", "MATH_0010": "$V'$", "MATH_0011": "$U' = \\Spec(A')$", "MATH_0012": "$V' = \\Spec(B')$", "MATH_0013": "$I'/(I')^2$", "MATH_0014": "$A'$", "MATH_0015": "$U'$", "MATH_0016": "$U'' \\subset U'$", "MATH_0017": "$V'$", "MATH_0018": "$V'' = V' \\cap f^{-1}(U'')$", "MATH_0019": "$I''/(I'')^2$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{algebra-lemma-section-smooth}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{algebra-lemma-section-smooth}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:73cb11449be11b3d4897ca0dcd9c38389a4d91b0f74b18d7672fb8a81dd7cf4d", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:60556f03c24c5f846ba551a70b948a7c461c269138516bf960b01eb53d24358c", "source_text": "Pick an affine open <MATH_0001> containing <MATH_0002>\nPick an affine open <MATH_0003> containing <MATH_0004>.\nPick an affine open <MATH_0005> containing <MATH_0006>.\nNote that <MATH_0007> is affine as it is equal to the\nfibre product <MATH_0008>. Then <MATH_0009> and <MATH_0010> satisfy (1).\nWrite <MATH_0011> and <MATH_0012>. By\nAlgebra, Lemma <REF_0001>\nthe module <MATH_0013> is finite locally free as a <MATH_0014>-module.\nHence after replacing <MATH_0015> by a smaller affine open <MATH_0016>\nand <MATH_0017> by <MATH_0018> we obtain the situation where\n<MATH_0019> is free, i.e., (2) holds. In this case (3) holds also by\nAlgebra, Lemma <REF_0002>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:4596f37b864fa0224c8502b100c35e91833fee5a91f0a5dbb3ad85113258b8f7", "unit_id": "tag:05D9:proof"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "01V4", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$X$", "MATH_0002": "$x$", "MATH_0003": "$X$", "MATH_0004": "$x$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{O}_{X,x}$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{properties-definition-dimension}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{topology-definition-Krull}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:a65b4881d64eff521adca49831e23dedc6123d170dc609cdcdb142713cb2233f", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:e9d6e07bfb46f948e87f14678120a03478ea73ad459311b1c7c8454ff8ab5405", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nThe dimension of a scheme <MATH_0001> at a point <MATH_0002>\n(Properties, Definition <REF_0001>)\nis just the dimension of <MATH_0003> at <MATH_0004> as a topological space, see\nTopology, Definition <REF_0002>.\nThis is not the dimension of the local ring <MATH_0005>, in general.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:111fb040cc17d14ed8a73945bb41b8da3e58d7f399aab470c4765f8d96bec9da", "unit_id": "tag:01V4:prose-0009"}
